OL,3,AVolkswagen board approves plan to cut
OL,4,Aanother 50,000 jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe board of German car giant
OL,7,FVolkswagen has approved a plan to cut
OL,8,Fanother 50,000 jobs as part of a
OL,9,Fsweeping turnaround programme. It
OL,10,Fbrings the total number of roles the
OL,11,Fcompany plans to shed by 2030 to
OL,12,F100,000.
OL,14,FThe group - which includes Audi,
OL,15,FPorsche, Skoda as well as the VW brand
OL,16,F- said in March that it would cut
OL,17,F50,000 roles by the end of the decade.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
